rt\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>d <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/day\"><span class=\"kw2620\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">day</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">15</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/day/operator_arith\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+=</span><span>operator-=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds or subtracts a number of days <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/day/operator_arith_2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+</span><span>operator-</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds or subtracts a number of days and a <code>day</code>, or find the difference between two <code>day</code>s <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/day","title":"std::chrono::day"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::day::operator++, std::chrono::day::operator--","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Adds or subtracts 1 from the day value."},{"label":"Parameters","n